{"id":"n14460-3-7","stage":2,"title":"뜯다 · 啃","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14460-3-7-1","ko":"내일 저녁에 다들 별일 없지? 오래간만에 회식이나 하지.","zh":"明天晚上大家应该都没什么事吧？好久没聚了，一起去吃顿饭吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"별일","meaning":"特别的事","explanation":"별일：特别的事","readings":[{"term":"별일","audio":"/audio/74ed112211390f050e73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14481","senseId":"2","lemma":"별일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별일","audio":"/audio/74ed112211390f050e73.mp3"}},{"text":"없지?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없지","audio":"/audio/1d76091ae1eea6a08772.mp3"}},{"text":"오래간만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오래간만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오래간만","audio":"/audio/8a0955df2aa26c841757.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68088","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래간만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래간만에","audio":"/audio/79be2dc5d6facaf3a2e9.mp3"}},{"text":"회식이나","meaning":"聚餐，会餐，饭局","explanation":"회식：聚餐，会餐，饭局；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"회식","audio":"/audio/b508d0255be0121e8575.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88144","senseId":"1","lemma":"회식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회식이나","audio":"/audio/e9e2dcd53a5061bb38a3.mp3"}},{"text":"하지.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"74ed112211390f05","term":"별일","zh":"特别的事","audio":"/audio/74ed112211390f050e73.mp3","entryId":"14481","definition":"与平常不同的特殊的事情。","pronunciation":["별릴"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"8a0955df2aa26c84","term":"오래간만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/8a0955df2aa26c841757.mp3","entryId":"68088","definition":"从有某事开始过了很久时间后。","pronunciation":["오래간만"]},{"id":"b508d0255be0121e","term":"회식","zh":"聚餐，会餐，饭局","audio":"/audio/b508d0255be0121e8575.mp3","entryId":"88144","definition":"同属于某组织或团体的人聚在一起吃饭；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː식","훼ː식"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/61cbc870b12eafc13682.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14460-3-7-2","ko":"좋지요. 오랜만에 고기를 뜯으러 갈까요?","zh":"好啊，好久没吃肉了，咱们去吃顿肉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋지요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지요","audio":"/audio/4d15e77807a0c6dc2fa0.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"고기를","meaning":"肉","explanation":"고기：肉；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고기","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31685","senseId":"1","lemma":"고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고기를","audio":"/audio/55ef2cdc26c3ebeef3a3.mp3"}},{"text":"뜯으러","meaning":"啃，撕咬","explanation":"뜯다：啃，撕咬；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"뜯다","audio":"/audio/41989424272f386dce03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14460","senseId":"3","lemma":"뜯다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜯으러","audio":"/audio/8f9a1b2bf299e6a8581a.mp3"}},{"text":"갈까요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈까요","audio":"/audio/8599ea70548e6c51ba52.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"645b9cec60f52032","term":"고기","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3","entryId":"31685","definition":"食用的动物肉。","pronunciation":["고기"]},{"id":"41989424272f386d","term":"뜯다","zh":"啃，撕咬","audio":"/audio/41989424272f386dce03.mp3","entryId":"14460","definition":"撕着吃草或难啃的食物。","pronunciation":["뜯따"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2cd7d35a5be7387f49d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.577,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14460","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3023,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。好久没吃烤肉了，咱们一起去吧？","天上全是乌云呢。","明天晚上大家应该都没什么事吧？好久没聚了，一起去吃顿饭吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好啊，好久没吃肉了，咱们去吃顿肉怎么样？","明天晚上大家应该都没什么事吧？好久没聚了，一起去吃顿饭吧。","天上全是乌云呢。"],"answer":0}]}
